      "writtenOn": "2020-07-09T04:53:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "UnbundledBuild() was introduced to indicate the mode which the whole system/platform isn\u0027t supposed to be built according to https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/build/+/1324512, while UnbundledBuildUsePrebuiltSdk means the module is built against prebuilt sdk.\n\nYes, both can be true.\nIf UnbundledBuildApps \u003d\u003d true, and it doesn\u0027t build sdk from source, both are true.",
      "parentUuid": "b73d258a_ca7cfebe",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 723,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 726,
        "endChar": 1
      },
      "revId": "21e60eadb8d15cb1f7044969f8cdf5cb745e3733",
